---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Profile - Explore About Us" 
  description="Corporate Profile of the Jammu & Kashmir State Power Development Corporation."
>
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
    <nav class="text-xs text-gray-500" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
      <ol class="flex gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:underline">Home</a></li>
        <li>/</li>
        <li><span class="text-gray-400">About Us</span></li>
        <li>/</li>
        <li><span class="text-gray-400">Explore</span></li>
        <li>/</li>
        <li><span class="font-semibold text-[#0B4F9C]">Profile</span></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="border-b border-gray-200 pb-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#0B4F9C]">Corporate Profile</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Incorporation details, legal status, and registration profile.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Main Text -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          The corporate structure and legal parameters of the Jammu & Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL) are detailed below.
        </p>

        <!-- Profile Table -->
        <div class="table-wrapper">
          <table class="table-data" aria-label="Corporate Profile Parameters">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col" class="w-1/3">Parameter</th>
                <th scope="col" class="w-2/3">Details</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Full Corporate Name</td>
                <td>Jammu and Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Legal Status</td>
                <td>Wholly owned Public Sector Undertaking (PSU) of the Government of Jammu & Kashmir</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Year of Incorporation</td>
                <td>1995 (under the Companies Act)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Mandate</td>
                <td>Take over, execute, complete and operate power stations and power projects of the erstwhile Jammu & Kashmir State.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Authorised Share Capital</td>
                <td class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Rs. 5,000.00 Crores</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Paid-up Share Capital</td>
                <td class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Rs. 2,593.3443 Crores</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Joint Venture Investments</td>
                <td>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Rs. 2,357.61 Crores</p>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">(Invested in JVs with NHPC namely Chenab Valley Power Projects CVPPPL & Ratle Hydroelectric Power Corporation RHPCL)</p>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Revenue from Power Sales</td>
                <td>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Rs. 1,136.94 Crores <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal">(Financial Year 2023-24)</span></p>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Profit Before Tax (PBT)</td>
                <td>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Rs. 361.64 Crores <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal">(Financial Year 2023-24)</span></p>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="font-bold text-[#0B4F9C]">Generation Infrastructure</td>
                <td>13 operating Hydroelectric Projects (HEPs) with a combined installed capacity of 1197.4 MW.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Sidebar Actions -->
      <aside class="space-y-4">
        <div class="card-static">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">Quick Navigation</h3>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#0B4F9C]">
            <li><a href="/about-us/explore/overview" class="hover:underline block py-1">&rarr; Overview</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about-us/explore/vision" class="hover:underline block py-1">&rarr; Vision Statement</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about-us/explore/mission" class="hover:underline block py-1">&rarr; Mission Statement</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about-us/explore/objectives" class="hover:underline block py-1">&rarr; Main Objectives</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
